松对俄能源制裁并削弱对莫斯科的经济压力。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/09/trump-putin-diesel-russia-sanctions-ukraine.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T23:16:50.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美联储报告显示美国家庭债务偿付压力升至大衰退后高位","summary":"美联储消费者财务调查显示，截至2025年底，逾期贷款支付的家庭比例从此前调查的约12%升至近20%，两个月或以上逾期的比例从2022年的5%升至超过8%。家庭债务支付收入比高于40%的比例升至8.6%，同时实际平均净资产增长7%至$1.24 million，但实际中位数净资产仅增长2%至$215,900，低收入家庭财富出现下降。","sourceName":"CNBC Markets","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/09/american-debt-delinquency.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T14:03:24.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"psfm4lawspdc9uszcwgx9je35"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"c1ilyg92ggjlaa6fo7qyfghma","title":"美国放松俄罗斯柴油贸易制裁，特朗普称俄将向美供油","summary":"美国财政部下属外国资产控制办公室宣布放松俄罗斯柴油贸易相关制裁，授权销售、交付、卸货或进口柴油的许可持续至美东时间2027年4月7日零时。特朗普称俄罗斯将立即向美国及世界市场提供超过30万吨柴油，11月提供50万吨，此后再提供100万吨。美国9日柴油平均零售价格为每加仑6.2785美元，同比上涨70.8%。","sourceName":"经济观察网","sourceUrl":"http://www.eeo.com.cn/2026/1010/1059306.shtml","publishedAt":"2026-10-10T01:52:10.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"特朗普称乌克兰应更换总统，并将美国柴油高价归咎于泽连斯基","summary":"美国总统特朗普表示乌克兰应更换总统，并称泽连斯基未能推动与俄罗斯达成协议，还将美国柴油价格上涨归咎于乌克兰。特朗普此前宣布俄罗斯将立即供应超过300,000吨柴油，随后在11月追加500,000吨，欧洲官员则担忧该协议将增加俄罗斯的战争收入。俄罗斯空袭乌克兰扎波罗热州造成至少20人死亡、18人受伤。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/10/trump-says-ukraine-should-get-a-new-president.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-10T19:19:07.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"gfa4u69pj7u1qfmjtmqvwqcf0"}]},{"label":"股票市场","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Lumentum CEO称光学器件售罄至2029年，部分需求缺口达70%","summary":"NVIDIA投资的Lumentum CEO Michael Hurlston表示，公司光学器件已售罄至2029年初，部分产品明年前约70%的需求无法满足，另一些产品至2028年仍有30%的需求缺口。Lumentum过去两年将东京工厂产能提升至原来的12倍，并计划向相关设施投入至少3.5亿美元；新建产能通常需要三至五年。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783261","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T07:42:20.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"w8hukj6r1jci6sunealht3aqz"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"Microsoft Azure 2026财年第四季度增长43%，AI投入推高资本开支","summary":"Microsoft 2026财年第四季度 Azure及其他云服务同比增长43%，全年 Azure 收入首次超过$100 billion。公司第四季度资本开支约为$41 billion，全年物业及设备新增投入达$115.9 billion，Microsoft Cloud 毛利率从上一季度的68%降至65%。","sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/microsoft-azure-43-percent-growth-ai-costs/","publishedAt":"2026-10-10T14:54:01.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"avsxipz347zj1i2t3p8uyxbbx"}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":"e0m6sk534sqitbzpennqr6wfw","title":"SpaceX收购800MHz频谱进军美国移动运营商市场","summary":"SpaceX宣布从Grain Management LLC收购覆盖全美的800MHz低频频谱牌照，并计划将其与Starlink卫星网络整合，打造独立的移动运营商业务。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783231","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T00:43:18.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"澳大利亚 AI 数据中心运营商 Firmus 撤回 50 亿美元 IPO 计划","summary":"获英伟达支持的澳大利亚 AI 数据中心运营商 Firmus 表示，因市场波动与市场状况，公司已撤回原计划筹资 50 亿美元的 IPO。Firmus 原拟以每股 11 澳元定价，估值约 306 亿美元，并将转向私募市场融资，同时考虑其他公开与私募市场选项。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2295372","publishedAt":"2026-10-10T07:16:44.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":5,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"NVIDIA支持的Firmus因投资者需求不足搁置A$5.5 billion澳大利亚IPO","summary":null,"sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/firmus-shelves-australian-ipo-weak-demand/","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T00:12:42.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"ud3vo6rqddai1bucoudgu3ljy"}],"citationId":"qw94eivpmjrsdf5arvdzwaf5y"}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"尊界V800制动测试引发安全质疑，江淮汽车再次跌停并将免费升级已交付车辆","summary":"懂车帝测试显示，3辆尊界V800在百公里紧急制动测试中出现刹车踏板支架断裂，真实踏板力峰值为1612N，网传4589N为拍摄造成的数字残影。尊界官方称未发生用户实际使用中的制动踏板支架底座断裂故障，但将优化部件设计并为已交付用户提供免费升级选择。10月9日江淮汽车盘中再次跌停，封单11万手。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783239","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T02:04:56.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"gf5btt5zykrhuf3pvlsyo41co"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"油轮运费升至六十年高位，从美国运油到中国一船成本达8000万美元","summary":"全球油轮运费因霍尔木兹海峡通行风险、船对船转运和船队周转受阻而大幅上涨，从美国运往中国的一船原油运输费用达到8000万美元，折合每桶41美元。租用VLCC从美国运往亚洲的费用升至7700万美元，远高于2025年全年均值920万美元；高运费正在压缩炼油利润，并推高二手油轮价格。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783314","publishedAt":"2026-10-10T02:42:17.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"i1mk9aybb12ki39no4vj65p86"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国政府暂停微软等企业PERM资格并调查9所高校J-1签证","summary":"美国副总统万斯宣布，微软、Adobe及多家科技和IT外包企业被暂停参与PERM劳工认证项目，已受理申请停止处理，新申请不予受理。美国政府同时调查哈佛大学、耶鲁大学、斯坦福大学等9所高校是否存在J-1签证欺诈或滥用，相关行动被指可能进一步收紧科技企业和高校的外籍人才渠道。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783215","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T16:14:52.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"i4mx6b28os2h0ja5dzw9w6kuy"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国2026财年预算赤字升至近2万亿美元，占GDP比例将超6%","summary":"美国国会预算办公室数据显示，截至9月30日的2026财年，美国联邦预算赤字升至1.993万亿美元，同比增长12%，赤字占GDP比例预计超过6%。联邦支出达7.4万亿美元，收入为5.4万亿美元，净利息支出超过1.1万亿美元，同比增长11%，已超过国防开支和Medicare支出。文章指出，高利率、减税政策和低于预期的关税收入共同加剧赤字，未来财政走向在很大程度上取决于中期选举结果。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783229","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T00:04:18.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"citationId":"e5z5u8asgu10gd71b9p97xoo0"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"疑似多名Ledger用户钱包遭盗，损失超8600万美元","summary":"链上分析师Specter称，X和Reddit上出现多起Ledger用户钱包被盗报告，涉及以太坊、TRON及比特币等多条主链，数百个受害钱包的总损失超8600万美元。三个BTC盗币地址在10月8日至9日共收到逾211枚BTC，尚未转出；被盗原因尚不明确，Ledger暂未回应。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a120aa-8322-7249-accc-814eafa630aa","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T12:36:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"硬件钱包经销商 CryptoBilis 3 月易主，股权指向中国黑龙江籍人士","summary":null,"sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2295313","publishedAt":"2026-10-10T01:18:57.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"f9g9o3rfjk1nvvtgcanu