2026-10-10","citationId":"zrrp9eknij2ijtix13j4t5vvt"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"英伟达调整自由现金流口径，上半财年调整后自由现金流约217亿美元","summary":"英伟达将自由现金流表述为扣除“战略用途”后的超额现金流；按股权投资和员工股权激励相关现金支出调整，其上半财年自由现金流约为217亿美元，较官方口径的699亿美元缩水约69%。同期，英伟达新增249亿美元长期债务至324亿美元，并斥资约310亿美元进行超出维持股本不变所需的额外回购。文章指出，英伟达2350亿美元回购授权的兑现能力取决于未来现金流，而持续的战略股权投资可能压缩实际可分配现金。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783308","publishedAt":"2026-10-10T01:10:09.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"yfhp3820g4edbpqhnps64t7d5"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"销量下滑下保时捷押注高价车型与定制业务","summary":"保时捷发布面向2035年的战略，计划增加高利润车型和个性化定制、精简产品组合并降低成本，将盈亏平衡所需的年销量降至20万辆以下。公司将长期销售回报率目标设为15%，并计划将顶级车型平均售价提高约20%、将Sonderwunsch定制项目收入提升至当前水平的六倍。中国市场交付量从2022年的9.33万辆降至2025年的4.19万辆，保时捷同时调整在华门店、产品供给和本土研发布局。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783255","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T05:55:01.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"a7stumy49yzy7a3solj4r3odc"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"尊界V800制动踏板支架连续断裂，江淮汽车连续两日跌停","summary":"尊界V800在100km/h至0的紧急制动测试中，三台车辆的制动踏板支架均发生断裂，江淮汽车10月9日连续2日跌停，报22.25元/股。测试显示，断裂后制动距离由约38米延长至约140米，真实峰值踏板力为1612N，并非网传的4589N。尊界汽车称实际使用中未发生相关故障，将优化部件设计并为已交付用户提供免费升级选择。","sourceName":"界面新闻","sourceUrl":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15170158.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T02:43:27.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"g7tb6tvcxvcfh5mno1ekv815q"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"尊界V800刹车踏板支架三次测试均断裂，伯特利否认供货","summary":"懂车帝测试显示，三台尊界V800在100km/h至0的紧急制动测试中刹车踏板支架均发生断裂，制动距离由约38米延长至约140米。尊界汽车称将优化部件设计并为已交付用户提供免费升级选择；伯特利董事长质疑测试属于侧向“别”断，伯特利方面否认向尊界供货。报道指出，公开画面中的结构和断裂原因尚未经汽车公司或独立检测机构确认。","sourceName":"界面新闻","sourceUrl":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15171225.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-09T08:22:44.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"hr78aejeq28kokwqmeux45m8b"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Vance称Microsoft用外籍员工替代裁员，H-1B数据呈现另一面","summary":"美国副总统JD Vance称Microsoft用H-1B签证员工替代了2025年裁掉的6,000名员工；特朗普政府同时暂停八家科技公司为外籍员工担保绿卡，但该措施不影响H-1B工作签证。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/10/vance-microsoft-h1b-layoffs-visa-data.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-10T14:22:23.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"ivdn7po7tgocyb0j4qk3jx1e5"}],